'''Vegetable soup''' is a common [[soup]] prepared using [[vegetable]]s (including [[leaf vegetable]]s, and sometimes loosely [[Edible mushroom|mushrooms]]) as primary ingredients. It dates to [[ancient history]], and in modern times is also a mass-produced food product.
